WEBVTT

00:02.160 --> 00:06.860
The fourth leaf of a clover holds good luck,

00:07.810 --> 00:11.500
while the fifth leaf is said
to be home to a demon.

00:13.420 --> 00:17.249
In the Clover Kingdom, a land
where magic is everything,

00:17.250 --> 00:20.509
Asta is the only boy who cannot use magic.

00:20.510 --> 00:25.629
He continues to train harder than
anyone else to become the Wizard King.

00:25.630 --> 00:31.660
What Asta eventually gains is the power
of Anti Magic, which can nullify all magic.

00:32.200 --> 00:36.129
Meanwhile, the Dark Triad
ruling the Spade Kingdom

00:36.130 --> 00:42.269
gains the power of devils from the underworld
and begins invading other kingdoms.

00:42.270 --> 00:47.389
After a fierce battle, Asta and the others
defeat one of the Dark Triad, Dante,

00:47.390 --> 00:53.729
but Captain Yami, Vangeance,
and Queen Lolopechka are taken away.

00:53.730 --> 00:59.409
Determined to rescue them, Asta seeks
to master the true power of the devil.

00:59.410 --> 01:04.050
The Clover Kingdom's
counterattack begins now!

01:13.430 --> 01:16.810
SPADE KINGDOM

01:53.150 --> 01:56.470
I assume my brother's
going to be all right...

01:57.820 --> 01:59.370
...Morris?

02:00.500 --> 02:05.700
Come on, I was in charge of all the sorcery
studies in the Diamond Kingdom.

02:06.340 --> 02:09.480
He'll recover just fine.

02:09.940 --> 02:12.350
And he'll be even stronger than before.

02:13.040 --> 02:17.989
Even the magic used for the Ritual of the Advent
was gathered by the Candelo I created.

02:17.990 --> 02:20.749
You should trust me more.

02:20.750 --> 02:24.249
I was driven out of the kingdom
because of that traitor Mars, but...

02:24.250 --> 02:27.009
It led me to a much more interesting place!

02:27.010 --> 02:29.750
I'm grateful to you all!

02:34.340 --> 02:39.759
Yeah, I can't wait to fight that boy again!

02:39.760 --> 02:42.539
Have all the other preparations
been taken care of?

02:42.540 --> 02:46.769
Everything is going smoothly.
Right, Lotus?

02:46.770 --> 02:48.339
Yeah.

02:48.340 --> 02:53.070
This is really bad in all sorts of ways.

02:55.150 --> 02:57.410
CLOVER CASTLE

03:00.100 --> 03:02.259
The tree that connects the underworld,

03:02.260 --> 03:05.809
where the devils dwell, and our world...
Tree of Qliphoth.

03:05.810 --> 03:10.169
Yami and Vangeance are needed to create it.

03:10.170 --> 03:13.580
In three days, the gates
to the underworld will open.

03:14.480 --> 03:19.680
Before that happens, we'll rescue Yami and
Vangeance and destroy the Tree of Qliphoth.

03:20.290 --> 03:22.930
This time, we're the ones
going on the offensive.

03:23.680 --> 03:27.710
To think I can do nothing as
the Wizard King at a time like this...

03:33.580 --> 03:35.449
You chose right.

03:35.450 --> 03:39.450
However, right people
aren't always rewarded.

03:39.790 --> 03:42.430
We're up!

03:43.140 --> 03:44.950
So, be stronger.

03:46.430 --> 03:50.100
Don't lose to the irrational evil.

03:58.930 --> 04:01.920
Unite Mode: Canis.

04:02.970 --> 04:07.230
From this point on, what you
call training begins in earnest.

04:07.780 --> 04:09.390
Come at me...

04:10.380 --> 04:13.380
...and defeat me.

05:38.530 --> 05:43.990
PAGE 171: THE BATTLE BEGINS

05:48.700 --> 05:53.409
Asta, the only way for you to get
stronger is to unite with that devil

05:53.410 --> 05:56.960
and draw out 100% of
your Anti Magic power.

05:59.860 --> 06:00.970
A tail?

06:11.380 --> 06:13.849
Huh? Liebe's gone?

06:13.850 --> 06:15.520
I'm here.

06:16.110 --> 06:17.939
You're so tiny!

06:17.940 --> 06:21.609
It looks like this is what happens
when I give you my power.

06:21.610 --> 06:29.419
In Devil-Binding contracts, the human
is always in complete control.

06:29.420 --> 06:33.119
That's why I can use Unite so easily.

06:33.120 --> 06:35.739
What you're doing isn't Unite.

06:35.740 --> 06:38.630
You're just letting
the devil's power flow out.

06:39.120 --> 06:41.619
Oh, right, Liebe said
something like that too!

06:41.620 --> 06:44.609
So how can I use your power?!

06:44.610 --> 06:46.030
Beats me.

06:47.140 --> 06:51.019
I was planning to take over
your body and fight, after all.

06:51.020 --> 06:53.899
It was also my first time fighting outside.

06:53.900 --> 06:56.559
That's why even a guy like you can beat me.

06:56.560 --> 06:59.359
So you don't know anything?!

06:59.360 --> 07:00.799
After you talked like a big shot?!

07:00.800 --> 07:03.539
This bullshit contract was all your idea!

07:03.540 --> 07:04.909
You do something about it!

07:04.910 --> 07:07.029
But I don't know either!

07:07.030 --> 07:08.529
I see.

07:08.530 --> 07:12.040
I suppose you'll have
to figure it out as you fight.

07:13.360 --> 07:18.830
By using Unite, I can imbue my Shadow Magic
with the abilities of different devils.

07:19.340 --> 07:21.620
One of Gimodelo's abilities is...

07:22.750 --> 07:24.070
...the "Pack."

07:33.310 --> 07:37.860
Every one of them has the same
Ki as Vice Captain Nacht!

07:39.020 --> 07:43.020
The shadows won't disappear
until you defeat me.

07:44.740 --> 07:46.239
He blends in with them...

07:46.240 --> 07:48.960
And I can't tell where he is!

07:49.270 --> 07:53.789
So Vice Captain Nacht has made
contracts with four devils?!

07:53.790 --> 07:56.899
Does that mean he's been
face-to-face with death that often?!

07:56.900 --> 08:01.629
Now that Liebe and I have formed a contract,
our bond is stronger than before.

08:01.630 --> 08:04.629
I should be able to draw out
more of his power!

08:04.630 --> 08:07.679
You formed an equal contract with the devil.

08:07.680 --> 08:14.099
Since you don't control the devil, it's only
natural that you can't use all of its power.

08:14.100 --> 08:16.850
This is the path you chose.

08:18.230 --> 08:21.730
Try to use that power to defeat me!

08:25.820 --> 08:26.490
Yes, sir!

08:30.980 --> 08:33.830
I'll surpass my limits right now.

08:42.130 --> 08:43.340
Demon-Slasher.

08:44.190 --> 08:47.840
Your name is the Demon-Slasher Katana.

08:48.400 --> 08:50.929
Let's go get Captain Yami together!

08:50.930 --> 08:53.640
Let's surpass the limits
right here, right now!

08:54.960 --> 08:57.390
I really don't like that phrase.

09:03.090 --> 09:09.309
Thank you for training with me,
former Vice Captain Langris.

09:09.310 --> 09:11.489
That "former" was uncalled for.

09:11.490 --> 09:14.659
You're as nasty as ever, huh.

09:14.660 --> 09:16.849
I'm no match for you.

09:16.850 --> 09:20.790
Come to think of it,
where's that noisy little spirit?

09:21.150 --> 09:24.540
Bell hasn't come out of my grimoire.

09:25.010 --> 09:27.310
Honestly, it's unbelievable.

09:31.090 --> 09:35.280
You managed to get this far
without the spirit's power.

09:44.180 --> 09:46.569
Another loss for you guys.

09:46.570 --> 09:50.299
Vice Captain Nacht is unbelievably strong!

09:50.300 --> 09:53.169
No matter how many times I try,
I just can't see a way to win!

09:53.170 --> 09:56.299
And he's probably not even
fighting for real yet!

09:56.300 --> 09:59.580
So this is the power of Unite!

09:59.940 --> 10:03.249
Why can't Liebe and I do that?!

10:03.250 --> 10:07.590
The injuries I suffered in Black Form
were also inflicted on Liebe!

10:14.090 --> 10:15.849
Yummy!

10:15.850 --> 10:18.799
And my wounds and stamina are recovering!

10:18.800 --> 10:22.379
You said the Spade Kingdom resistance
members made these with magic, right?

10:22.380 --> 10:25.149
I should thank them when I see them!

10:25.150 --> 10:27.549
Eating something sweet gave me an idea!

10:27.550 --> 10:29.110
Come with me, Liebe!

10:29.900 --> 10:31.739
When he gets like this,

10:31.740 --> 10:35.810
there's a 10% chance he'll come up
with something insanely brilliant.

10:38.370 --> 10:40.829
Combine!

10:40.830 --> 10:44.079
He was, of course,
in the 90% idiot category.

10:44.080 --> 10:46.959
This isn't the time to mess
around, you 90% idiot!

10:46.960 --> 10:49.039
I'm not messing around!

10:49.040 --> 10:53.419
By fighting like this, our minds
and bodies will become one!

10:53.420 --> 10:56.940
Aren't you tired of being a goody-goody?

10:57.620 --> 11:00.639
What about you? Doesn't doing
your own thing get tiring?

11:00.640 --> 11:05.139
You idiot. What's tiring about being free?

11:05.140 --> 11:08.189
If becoming one were this easy,
we wouldn't have a problem, you 90% idiot!

11:08.190 --> 11:10.899
What did you say?! You're the one
on top, so stop complaining!

11:10.900 --> 11:13.299
It's almost time to meet up.

11:13.300 --> 11:18.409
What?! It's already been two days?!
I didn't even notice it!

11:18.410 --> 11:20.180
Guess I have no choice.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.119
If it's not going to work anyway...

11:25.120 --> 11:26.770
...then die here.

11:28.630 --> 11:29.959
Liebe!

11:29.960 --> 11:33.030
Mana Zone: Dark Prison Hunting Ground.

11:37.870 --> 11:39.470
It's pitch black...

11:42.060 --> 11:43.470
This is...!

11:45.680 --> 11:49.309
I can't sense their Ki at all!

11:49.310 --> 11:51.939
There's no way to dodge their attacks!

11:51.940 --> 11:55.719
You did have potential, but what a shame.

11:55.720 --> 11:58.949
Death is creeping upon me
from the darkness I can't sense...

11:58.950 --> 12:02.120
This is true terror!

12:07.860 --> 12:12.040
Dammit! Our backs are really
against the wall, but why...?!

12:12.510 --> 12:17.050
Both Asta and I want power...!

12:17.650 --> 12:22.680
But why... Why we can't Unite?!

12:23.100 --> 12:25.930
If I'm going to save Captain Yami...

12:26.400 --> 12:29.840
If I'm going to avenge Licita...

12:31.060 --> 12:33.649
I can't die here!

12:33.650 --> 12:38.290
And also... I can't let this guy die either!

13:10.830 --> 13:14.309
He intentionally avoided hitting me directly.

13:14.310 --> 13:18.569
He didn't even touch me,
yet the Unite on my arm was nullified.

13:18.570 --> 13:23.569
And he erased my intangible magic
along with the Mana Zone!

13:23.570 --> 13:28.700
Anti Magic... If he can really
unleash its full power, then...

13:30.430 --> 13:32.029
He will be the strongest.

13:32.030 --> 13:33.539
I lose.

13:33.540 --> 13:36.749
Alright! Then, let's hurry up and go!

13:36.750 --> 13:37.779
No.

13:37.780 --> 13:41.629
Why not?! Liebe and I managed to use Unite!

13:41.630 --> 13:43.569
Yes, but only for a moment.

13:43.570 --> 13:46.930
You haven't mastered it yet.

13:47.510 --> 13:51.040
You must know that, too. Don't you?

13:52.020 --> 13:56.019
He's right. But we've come this far...

13:56.020 --> 14:00.829
If you went into enemy territory
like this, you'd end up dead.

14:00.830 --> 14:01.899
But I...!

14:01.900 --> 14:04.159
I watched you

14:04.160 --> 14:06.619
and the other Black Bulls using shadow magic.

14:06.620 --> 14:07.660
Huh?

14:07.950 --> 14:12.290
You were born without magic. And you
were possessed by a devil by accident.

14:12.670 --> 14:15.170
And toyed with by cruel fate.

14:15.630 --> 14:16.920
But...

14:18.970 --> 14:21.200
You were always right.

14:22.680 --> 14:28.350
I said that people who were right
weren't necessarily rewarded.

14:28.750 --> 14:32.350
But I would like them to be.

14:33.110 --> 14:34.610
Vice Captain Nacht...

14:38.110 --> 14:39.320
I'll leave Gimodelo here.

14:41.430 --> 14:44.580
We'll do the best we can until you get there.

14:45.280 --> 14:47.460
So make sure you're ready...

14:48.910 --> 14:50.420
...and come join us.

14:51.810 --> 14:52.990
Yes!

14:53.460 --> 14:56.669
If they hit me with that, I'm dead meat!

14:56.670 --> 14:59.190
You're so cruel, Mister Nacht!

15:00.770 --> 15:04.049
Please take care of us, Gimodelo!

15:04.050 --> 15:08.370
T-They want me dead so badly!

15:34.940 --> 15:37.600
All right, let's go.

15:38.800 --> 15:41.799
Looks like everyone's here.
Are you guys ready?

15:41.800 --> 15:43.709
CRIMSON LION CAPTAIN, FUEGOLEON VERMILLION
Where's Asta?

15:43.710 --> 15:46.299
AQUA DEER CAPTAIN, RILL BOISMORTIER
It's going to take him a little longer.

15:46.300 --> 15:47.999
GREEN MANTIS CAPTAIN, JACK THE RIPPER
Heh, it's not like we're

15:48.000 --> 15:50.099
GREEN MANTIS, SEKKE BRONZAZZA
counting on him in the first place!

15:50.100 --> 15:52.849
BLUE ROSE CAPTAIN, CHARLOTTE ROSELEI
Aww, Asta is not coming?

15:52.850 --> 15:54.369
VALTOS - SALLY - RADES SPIRITO
Well, I guess that's okay.

15:54.370 --> 15:56.079
VALTOS - SALLY - RADES SPIRITO
Looks like I'm about to see

15:56.080 --> 15:57.939
VALTOS - SALLY - RADES SPIRITO
something really interesting.

15:57.940 --> 16:00.359
CORAL PEACOCK CAPTAIN, DOROTHY UNSWORTH
It'll be a great test for the magic items I made

16:00.360 --> 16:03.279
GOLDEN DAWN, LANGRIS VAUDE
after studying Asta's physical makeup!

16:03.280 --> 16:07.569
SILVER EAGLE CAPTAIN, NOZEL SILVA
Are these robes she made for us really safe?

16:07.570 --> 16:10.299
MAKUSA NORTH
Sally is a little odd,

16:10.300 --> 16:12.079
MAKUSA NORTH
but when it comes to magic item research,

16:12.080 --> 16:13.019
RALPH NIAFLEM
she's second to none!

16:13.020 --> 16:14.329
RALPH NIAFLEM
So you don't have to worry!

16:14.330 --> 16:18.179
Makusa! Don't butt in just because
this is about magic items!

16:18.180 --> 16:20.349
Oh, take a look, Rades!

16:20.350 --> 16:24.299
This robe has an effect that
conceals your magic power!

16:24.300 --> 16:28.339
After studying Asta's Anti Magic,
just as Sally suggested...

16:28.340 --> 16:29.899
- Shut up!
- Magic really is fascinating!

16:29.900 --> 16:31.009
- Good grief.
- Magic really is fascinating!

16:31.010 --> 16:33.060
Wh... Why...

16:33.520 --> 16:39.690
Why do I have to join this dangerous mission
with all these crazy strong people?!

16:40.290 --> 16:43.810
Sure, I spent the past
six months living it up, but...

16:44.980 --> 16:51.069
Sekke! Go ahead and display
your latent power for me!

16:51.070 --> 16:52.449
Fuhha!

16:52.450 --> 16:56.699
Nobody told me I was headed
into a hell like this one!

16:56.700 --> 16:59.809
I don't know why you're here,

16:59.810 --> 17:03.460
but if you're doing this,
you'd better get serious about it!

17:04.670 --> 17:08.030
Sacrifice yourself for the sake
of the people who are right.

17:09.220 --> 17:11.599
Will Asta make it in time?

17:11.600 --> 17:13.180
He'll definitely come.

17:13.720 --> 17:17.470
GOLDEN DAWN VICE CAPTAIN, YUNO
But I'll end it all before he arrives.

17:18.580 --> 17:20.479
Nuh-uh! It'll be me!

17:20.480 --> 17:22.479
It won't be you either.

17:22.480 --> 17:25.200
Shadow Magic: Shadow Corridor.

17:30.180 --> 17:31.660
It'll be us.

17:37.840 --> 17:38.869
Oh?

17:38.870 --> 17:41.040
They're here.

17:41.470 --> 17:43.310
It's the Resistance.

17:44.740 --> 17:48.209
Listen up, Dark Triad!

17:48.210 --> 17:51.649
17 years ago, you killed our king,
Lord Loyce,

17:51.650 --> 17:53.719
and many of our comrades!

17:53.720 --> 17:58.219
Ever since then, you've used
the citizens in abominable ways!

17:58.220 --> 18:01.100
We'll never forgive you!

18:01.840 --> 18:06.879
We know well even if we fought you
to the death, we couldn't defeat you.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.620
Even so...!

18:09.620 --> 18:16.179
We, the people of the Spade Kingdom,
refuse to acknowledge you...

18:16.180 --> 18:18.130
...as our rulers!

18:20.690 --> 18:23.500
Now then, let's follow the plan.

18:25.570 --> 18:29.059
You're saying you were undercover
in the Spade Kingdom

18:29.060 --> 18:32.919
and you've been in contact with
the Resistance since you left our country?

18:32.920 --> 18:37.819
Yes. I wasn't planning to interfere
with you too much,

18:37.820 --> 18:42.780
but after seeing your abilities and actions,
I thought it would be better to help you.

18:43.140 --> 18:46.619
I saw your determination during the meeting.

18:46.620 --> 18:48.609
Sorry for pretending I didn't know.

18:48.610 --> 18:50.160
Unbelieveable...

18:51.060 --> 18:53.399
We're counting on you, Mister Nacht!

18:53.400 --> 18:55.569
The strongest Magic Knights
of the Clover Kingdom!

18:55.570 --> 18:57.620
And Lord Yuno!

18:58.130 --> 19:02.120
We'll create that diversion for you,
even if it costs our loves!

19:07.460 --> 19:09.810
What is this tremble?!

19:19.980 --> 19:21.349
That's...

19:21.350 --> 19:24.180
The legendary ancient demon?!

19:24.990 --> 19:27.849
In the face of overwhelming power,

19:27.850 --> 19:31.440
feelings, determination, and
everything else are meaningless.

19:32.100 --> 19:35.329
Since those rats had infiltrated the castle,

19:35.330 --> 19:40.950
I expected the Resistance to make
some kind of move during the ritual...

19:41.340 --> 19:45.209
But I never expected they'd
just appear bold as brass.

19:45.210 --> 19:47.789
I was planning to destroy the entire city

19:47.790 --> 19:50.790
along with its people using the demon anyway.

19:52.460 --> 19:56.189
You are not citizens of the Spade Kingdom.

19:56.190 --> 20:00.469
Only we, the strong, are true
citizens of the Spade Kingdom.

20:00.470 --> 20:04.030
Let's begin the ritual
of the Advent of Qliphoth.

20:07.560 --> 20:11.039
This sound...
It's stupendous magic!

20:11.040 --> 20:13.069
Are the ones outside all right?

20:13.070 --> 20:14.570
They're fine.

20:33.670 --> 20:36.669
Impressive howling, Resistance members!

20:36.670 --> 20:42.400
I, Mereoleona Vermillion, a royal
of the Clover Kingdom, will lend you my strength!

20:45.200 --> 20:50.879
The Ritual of the Advent is a huge magic
circle powered by four functions.

20:50.880 --> 20:54.909
One is the Qliphoth Advent site at the center.

20:54.910 --> 20:59.540
The other three are the Dark Triad,
who will activate the ritual.

21:00.450 --> 21:05.239
If we defeat all three Triad
members and disable the ritual,

21:05.240 --> 21:10.250
the Advent of Qliphoth will stop, and we
can prevent the gates from opening.

21:10.660 --> 21:14.499
We could also try destroying
the Qliphoth itself with Anti Magic,

21:14.500 --> 21:17.259
but that isn't guaranteed to work.

21:17.260 --> 21:21.339
If we forcefully destroy it and Yami
and Vangeance die in the process,

21:21.340 --> 21:23.260
you wouldn't forgive us, would you?

21:23.940 --> 21:27.549
The Triad is positioned at three points
around the edge of the magic circle.

21:27.550 --> 21:31.520
So we'll split into three groups, attack them
simultaneously, and take them down.

21:32.210 --> 21:34.519
Even with a diversion
outside the royal castle,

21:34.520 --> 21:37.599
we may run into Dark Disciples.

21:37.600 --> 21:39.149
Intruders!

21:39.150 --> 21:43.490
When you do, have someone act as a decoy...

21:48.000 --> 21:53.650
...and let as many people as possible
go on to strike the Triad.

22:07.810 --> 22:10.850
Stop right there, Dark Triad!
